  {"code":"08036","name":"The Trial of Strength","type":"quest","typeName":"Quest","sphere":null,"traits":[],"isUnique":false,"cost":null,"deckLimit":null,"threat":null,"willpower":null,"attack":null,"defense":null,"health":null,"questPoints":null,"victory":null,"engagementCost":null,"quantity":1,"easyQuantity":0,"encounterSet":"The Three Trials","stage":"2A","keywords":{},"timings":["whenRevealed","constant","constant"],"text":"When Revealed: Randomly choose 1 of the remaining set aside Guardian enemies and 1 of the remaining set aside Barrow locations, reveal them, and add them to the staging area. Find the set aside Key objective that shares a Trait with the just revealed Guardian enemy and attach it to that enemy.","shadowText":null,"campaignKind":null,"burdenSet":null,"backType":null,"hasErrata":false,"errata":null,"imagesrc":null,"deckLegal":false,"back":{"name":null,"text":"Each Guardian enemy engages the first player. Barrow locations cannot be the active location and are immune to player card effects.\nWhen the players control the current trial's Key objective, add all Barrow locations in play to the victory display and immediately advance to a stage 2A of the players' choice. If all stage 2 quests have been defeated, advance to stage 3A, instead.","questPoints":null,"stage":"2B"},"printings":[{"pack":"TTT","number":36,"hobSlug":"The-Trial-of-Strength-TTT","octgnGuid":"8e6fe06e-36a6-491d-ae17-6580ddfd8014","imageUrls":["https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/8e6fe06e-36a6-491d-ae17-6580ddfd8014.B.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Three-Trials/The-Trial-of-Strength-2A.jpg","https://s3.amazonaws.com/hallofbeorn-resources/Images/Cards/The-Three-Trials/The-Trial-of-Strength-2B.jpg"]}]},
